{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gingerbread Holiday</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gingerbread Holiday</i>\u00a0is a romantic otome visual novel about figuring out how it is to celebrate Christmas when having bad ties to the Holiday.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837750/extras/cg1_2.png?t=1751620954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Gabby as you bake gingerbread with your long term caring and supportive boyfriend, Mikael. Battle through the hardships that come with Christmas with your awesome boyfriend who will never let you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837750/extras/gingerbreadfairy.png?t=1751620954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Specs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 romance route<br>5 CGs<br>Original soundtrack<br>3 endings<br>2600+ words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Genres:\u00a0</i>Romance, Otome, Visual Novel<br><i>Platforms:</i>\u00a0Windows, Mac, Linux<br><i>Language:\u00a0</i>English (US)<br><i>Screen Resolution:</i>\u00a01920x1080 (Full HD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837750/extras/sdsx1m.jpg?t=1751620954\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Winter VN 2022 Jam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This was made for the Winter VN 2022 Jam. The project is released and complete. It wasn't made as a demo of a larger project.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837750?t=1751620954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837750/d608fb3f0a32bace547b11e9fbfe55b87a6f558c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751620954","c